   property of Verax Sistemas (the "Owner") and is protected by Brazilian Law No. 9,609/1998, Brazilian Law No.
   9,610/1998 and the applicable international treaties.

2. Purpose of publication. The source code is public only for reading, security review and auditing by customers,
   prospective customers and security researchers. Publication transfers no rights in the Software and is not an
   open source license.

3. What is allowed without an agreement:
   a) reading the source code in the public repository and in local copies made only for such reading;
   b) analyzing it, including with automated tools, and running it locally, in an isolated non-production
      environment, only to assess the security, privacy and behavior of the Software, without serving third parties
      and without third-party data;
   c) reporting vulnerabilities and quoting short excerpts, with attribution, in security reports, advisories and
      academic work, in accordance with section 6.
   GitHub features for public repositories (viewing and forking within GitHub) apply only to the extent required by
