4. What is prohibited without the Owner's prior written authorization, in a signed agreement:
   a) using the Software, in whole or in part, for any purpose outside section 3, including internal or production
      use;
   b) copying, reproducing, modifying, translating, adapting or creating derivative works, beyond what section 3
      allows;
   c) distributing, publishing, sublicensing, selling, renting, lending, assigning or transferring the Software or
      derivative works;
   d) running the Software for third parties or offering it as a service, including as software as a service, a
