   e) removing or altering copyright, license or trademark notices.
   This license does not authorize testing against production environments of the Owner or its customers.

5. Trademarks. This license grants no rights to the names "Verax", "Verax Sistemas" and "Verax Control", the logos
   or any other distinctive sign of the Owner.

6. Responsible disclosure. Report vulnerabilities privately, as described in this repository's SECURITY.md file,
   and do not disclose them before the deadline agreed with the Owner.

7. Third-party components. Third-party components used by the Software remain under their own licenses, and this
